post.description:
Batch save buyer codes within a single database transaction.
- Validates ALL records first (fail fast)
- If any record fails validation, returns all errors without saving anything
- If validation passes, processes all creates and updates
- If any record fails during processing, rolls back entire batch
- Returns all successfully saved records or detailed errors for each failed record

Request format:
{
    "recordsToCreate": [
        {
            "buyerCode": "B001",
            "buyerName": "Buyer Name"
        }
    ],
    "recordsToUpdate": [
        {
            "buyerCode": "B002",
            "buyerName": "Updated Buyer Name"
        }
    ]
}

